The '''Ruins of Zul'Razar''' are the southern portion of the troll city of [[Zul'Razar]] located in [[Gillijim's Isle]]. Having been overrun by the ogres of the [[Maul'ogg]], the ogres were themselves later driven out by a horde of creepers led by a massive beast named [[Tanglemoss]].<ref>{{questlong|Horde|53+|Tanglemoss (quest)|Tanglemoss}}</ref>

